cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "Chord Diagram Studio"
abstract: >-
  Chord Diagram Studio turns Spearman correlation and p-value matrices from
  Excel into publication-ready chord diagrams. It shows only significant
  correlations between variable categories, and lets you exclude categories,
  choose which strength categories to draw, compare groups or
  time-points, combine several files (e.g. studies) in one diagram, add rings
  for category groups, regions and files with a count scale, list the
  correlations that change between two groups, and count correlations by
  sign and strength. Available as a browser application and as desktop
  programs for Mac, Windows and Linux.
